 <Text 40 25 18 #000080 0 "THREE-PHASE SPWM SIC INVERTER - V3 WORKING MODEL">
 <Text 40 58 11 #000000 0 "Qucs-S 26.1 / ngspice | Smooth tanh logic only | Every behavioural source separately grounded">
 <Text 55 105 12 #000080 0 "1. THREE-PHASE REFERENCES AND 40 kHz CARRIER">
 <Text 700 105 12 #000080 0 "2. SIX PWM COMMANDS WITH DEAD BAND">
 <Text 1020 105 12 #000080 0 "3. FLOATING +18 V / -3.5 V GATE DRIVE">
 <Text 1400 65 12 #000080 0 "4. 750 V DC LINK AND THREE-PHASE BEHAVIOURAL SIC BRIDGE">
 <Text 1360 750 12 #000080 0 "5. 2 mH FILTERS, 2 Ohm + 10 uF DAMPING, 20 Ohm STAR LOAD">
 <Text 75 675 11 #000000 0 "FULL RUN: Stop=60 ms, maximum step=200 ns. Select ngspice and press F2.">
 <Text 75 790 10 #000000 0 "PWM and gate logic use tanh() only. No unsupported conditional function is present.">
